WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:02.440
The Wunu and we are mortal enemies.

00:02.680 --> 00:04.320
I have no time to deal with him now.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.440
Not executing him on the spot is already mercy enough.

00:06.520 --> 00:08.500
Tell him to get lost! / By your command!

00:11.600 --> 00:17.040
A few days later, the main force of the Qingzhou Army caught up with you, and you were forced to engage them.

00:17.440 --> 00:22.480
After days of bitter fighting, still unable to secure victory, the army's morale collapsed.

00:22.680 --> 00:26.500
Fearing future purges and execution by the court, the soldiers defected one after another,

00:26.800 --> 00:30.320
And you tragically perished amidst the chaotic rout.
